<t t-name="website.bathroom-space">
  <t t-call="website.layout">
    <div id="wrap" class="oe_structure oe_empty">
      <section data-snippet="s_text_block" class="s_text_block o_colored_level s_custom_BathroomDetailHero pt40 pb56" data-name="Text" data-custom-name="BathroomDetailHero" style="background-image: none;">
        <div class="container">
          <div class="row align-items-center">
            <div class="col-lg-6 o_colored_level">
              <div class="s_text" data-snippet="s_text" data-name="Text">
                <p class="h6 text-uppercase detailEyebrow mb-2">應用場域</p>
                <h1 class="mb-3">衛浴空間</h1>
                <p class="mb-0 detailLead">衛浴空間不僅是住宅中水壓變動最頻繁、濕氣最重的區域，更是洗去一天疲憊的重要生活空間。益全憑藉著豐富的製造經驗，為您提供卓越的技術與結構強韌的軟管。從隱蔽的給水系統到每日觸摸的淋浴設備，我們深知每一條軟管的穩定性，都直接關係到居住的安全與舒適度。</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-lg-5 mt-4 mt-lg-0 o_colored_level">
              <img src="https://picsum.photos/seed/yc-bathroom-hero/980/740" class="img-fluid rounded" alt="衛浴空間主視覺" loading="lazy"/>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="s_vertical_layout s_custom_BathroomContentShell" data-snippet="s_vertical_layout" data-name="Vertical Layout" data-custom-name="BathroomContentShell">
