                  <ol class="bm-tpl-holder py-0 px-0 breadcrumb my-2 bg-transparent">
                    <li class="breadcrumb-item o_not_editable"><a href="/">Home</a></li>
                    <li class="breadcrumb-item custom-item"><a href="/">Categories</a></li>
                    <li class="breadcrumb-item active current-page">bathroom-spaceV2</li>
                  </ol>
                </div>
              </div>
            </section>

            <section data-snippet="s_text_block" class="s_text_block o_colored_level pt48 pb64 s_custom_BathroomIntro" data-name="Text" data-custom-name="BathroomIntro">
              <div class="container">
                <div class="row">
                  <div class="col-12">
                    <div class="s_text" data-snippet="s_text" data-name="Text">
                      <h2 class="mb-3">衛浴環境的特殊需求</h2>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="col-md-4 mb-3 mb-md-0">
                    <div class="detailIconCard h-100">
                      <p class="h5 mb-2"><i class="fa fa-random mr-2"/>給水系統的靈活連接</p>
                      <p class="mb-0">衛浴安裝往往需要配合複雜的空間動線，益全提供客製化的長度選擇，解決您的配管難題。</p>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="col-md-4 mb-3 mb-md-0">
                    <div class="detailIconCard h-100">
                      <p class="h5 mb-2"><i class="fa fa-shower mr-2"/>優化淋浴操作體驗</p>
                      <p class="mb-0">防纏繞設計確保使用過程中軟管不打結。外層平滑易清潔，搭配多樣化的外觀選擇，能完美契合各式鍍鉻衛浴龍頭。</p>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="col-md-4">
                    <div class="detailIconCard h-100">
                      <p class="h5 mb-2"><i class="fa fa-shield mr-2"/>強化防護與有效抗壓</p>
                      <p class="mb-0">不鏽鋼編織軟管採用結構性強的白鐵材質，能有效防止內管爆裂並抵禦害蟲破壞，確保長效耐用。</p>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </section>

            <section data-snippet="s_text_block" class="s_text_block o_colored_level pt48 pb48 s_custom_BathroomCategoryTitle" data-name="Text" data-custom-name="BathroomCategoryTitle">
              <div class="container">
                <div class="s_text" data-snippet="s_text" data-name="Text">
                  <h2 class="mb-2">衛浴空間的產品分類</h2>
                  <p class="mb-0">水龍頭、馬桶、熱水器、淋浴/抽拉式、洗衣機。</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </section>

            <section data-snippet="s_text_block" class="s_text_block o_colored_level pt64 pb40 s_custom_BathroomCategoryItem" data-name="Text" data-custom-name="BathroomCategoryItem">
              <div class="container">
                <div class="row align-items-center categoryRow">
                  <div class="col-lg-5 mb-4 mb-lg-0"><img src="https://picsum.photos/seed/yc-faucet-detail/1000/700" class="img-fluid rounded" alt="水龍頭" loading="lazy"/></div>
                  <div class="col-lg-7">
                    <div class="s_text" data-snippet="s_text" data-name="Text">
                      <h3 class="mb-2 itemTitle"><i class="fa fa-tint mr-2"/>水龍頭</h3>
                      <p class="mb-2">水龍頭軟管隱藏於檯面下，連接三角凡而與龍頭底部。由於頻繁開關水易產生瞬間壓力，益全針對此特性優化了結構設計：</p>
                    </div>
                    <ul class="mb-0 categoryList">
                      <li>①具備承受開關水的「水錘壓力」設計，確保在高頻率使用下，軟管維持穩定不變形。</li>
                      <li>②因應檯面下方的狹窄空間，提供易彎曲且結構不變形的軟管，大幅降低施工難度。</li>
                      <li>③安全材質保障：產品有通過CUPC、NSF、CSA認證，讓您在使用上能更加安心。</li>
                    </ul>
                    <p class="mt-3 mb-0">以下是適合安裝在衛浴空間水龍頭的相關產品：</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </section>

            <section data-snippet="s_text_block" class="s_text_block o_colored_level pt48 pb40 s_custom_BathroomCategoryItem" data-name="Text" data-custom-name="BathroomCategoryItem">
              <div class="container">
                <div class="row align-items-center categoryRow">
                  <div class="col-lg-7 order-2 order-lg-1 mt-4 mt-lg-0">
                    <div class="s_text" data-snippet="s_text" data-name="Text">
                      <h3 class="mb-2 itemTitle"><i class="fa fa-building-o mr-2"/>馬桶</h3>
                      <p class="mb-2">馬桶軟管負責將牆面給水孔引導至水箱，對於維護廁所的乾爽與安全至關重要。</p>
                    </div>
                    <ul class="mb-0 categoryList">
                      <li>①穩定不滲漏：採用精密加工的接頭與高品質密封墊片，確保長期受壓下依然滴水不漏，杜絕滲漏引發的霉味與裝潢受損。</li>
                      <li>②多元規格對接：提供多種標準接頭尺寸，能完美對接各類品牌水箱進水閥。</li>
                    </ul>
                    <p class="mt-3 mb-0">以下是適合安裝在馬桶的相關產品：</p>
                  </div>
                  <div class="col-lg-5 order-1 order-lg-2"><img src="https://picsum.photos/seed/yc-toilet-detail/1000/700" class="img-fluid rounded" alt="馬桶" loading="lazy"/></div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </section>

            <section data-snippet="s_text_block" class="s_text_block o_colored_level pt48 pb40 s_custom_BathroomCategoryItem" data-name="Text" data-custom-name="BathroomCategoryItem">
              <div class="container">
                <div class="row align-items-center categoryRow">
                  <div class="col-lg-5 mb-4 mb-lg-0"><img src="https://picsum.photos/seed/yc-heater-detail/1000/700" class="img-fluid rounded" alt="熱水器" loading="lazy"/></div>
                  <div class="col-lg-7">
                    <div class="s_text" data-snippet="s_text" data-name="Text">
                      <h3 class="mb-2 itemTitle"><i class="fa fa-fire mr-2"/>熱水器</h3>
                      <p class="mb-2">熱水器連接管需同時面對「高溫」與「高壓」的嚴苛挑戰，是居家供水系統中最需重視安全的一環：</p>
                    </div>
                    <ul class="mb-0 categoryList">
                      <li>①益全的軟管外層採用不鏽鋼絲編織，有效防止因熱脹冷縮導致的管體疲勞，確保使用上的安全性，是電熱水器與瓦斯熱水器的理想首選。</li>
                      <li>②大流量設計確保熱水供應充足且順暢，提升沐浴時的恆溫舒適感。</li>
                    </ul>
                    <p class="mt-3 mb-0">以下是適合安裝在衛浴空間熱水器的相關產品：</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </section>

            <section data-snippet="s_text_block" class="s_text_block o_colored_level pt48 pb40 s_custom_BathroomCategoryItem" data-name="Text" data-custom-name="BathroomCategoryItem">
              <div class="container">
                <div class="row align-items-center categoryRow">
                  <div class="col-lg-7 order-2 order-lg-1 mt-4 mt-lg-0">
                    <div class="s_text" data-snippet="s_text" data-name="Text">
                      <h3 class="mb-2 itemTitle"><i class="fa fa-shower mr-2"/>淋浴/抽拉式</h3>
                      <p class="mb-2">淋浴軟管、抽拉式龍頭軟管不僅是配件，更是影響使用體驗與整體衛浴質感的關鍵。益全結合材料選擇與結構設計，著重於抗纏繞性能、耐用性與外觀一致性，適用於多元衛浴風格。</p>
                    </div>
                    <ul class="mb-0 categoryList">
                      <li>①益全製造的淋浴軟管提供 PVC 與 Santoprene 兩種內管材質，滿足多樣化市場與應用條件。</li>
                      <li>②採用雙扣式不鏽鋼結構，有效降低纏繞與打結問題，確保彎折後的管徑不變形，使用過程順暢自如。</li>
                      <li>③提供多種表面處理配色，與各式衛浴龍頭搭配，提升衛浴空間的一致性與質感。</li>
                    </ul>
                    <p class="mt-3 mb-0">以下是適合安裝在淋浴設備的相關產品：</p>
                  </div>
                  <div class="col-lg-5 order-1 order-lg-2"><img src="https://picsum.photos/seed/yc-shower-detail/1000/700" class="img-fluid rounded" alt="淋浴抽拉式" loading="lazy"/></div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </section>

            <section data-snippet="s_text_block" class="s_text_block o_colored_level pt48 pb64 s_custom_BathroomCategoryItem" data-name="Text" data-custom-name="BathroomCategoryItem">
              <div class="container">
